        "text_DPA6Va": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Warranty",
            "answer": "<p>We provide a <strong>10-year warranty</strong> on our Stainless Steel Gravity Water Filter housings, ensuring they are fully protected against defects in materials and workmanship.<br/><br/>The Phoenix Gravity Stainless Steel Spigot and Carbon Filter Elements come with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>, covering any defects in materials and workmanship. All other parts and accessories are backed by a <strong>6-month warranty.</strong><br/><br/>With these warranties, you’re protected against any defects in materials and workmanship.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_C9YBez": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Shipping & Returns",
            "answer": "<p><strong>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee :</strong><br/><br/>The 100-day money-back guarantee applies exclusively to filter systems purchased directly from <a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/\">https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/</a>.<br/><br/><strong>Return Process:</strong><br/><br/>To initiate a return, customers must contact our customer support team and provide valid website order details. Once verified, the support team will approve the return and provide detailed instructions on how and where to send the product.<br/><br/><strong>Important Notes:</strong><br/><br/>Products returned without prior authorization will not be accepted.<br/>Products must be returned in their original packaging and free from damage.<br/><br/><strong>Shipping:</strong><br/><br/>Most orders are processed and shipped within 3–7 business days. Thank you for your patience.<br/>We ship anywhere within the USA.<br/>Free shipping applies to retail customer orders of $99.99 or more shipped domestically.<br/>Orders are normally shipped via UPS Ground, USPS Priority Mail, or USPS First Class Mail.<br/><br/><strong>Please note: </strong>UPS does not deliver to PO Boxes or Military Addresses.<br/><br/><strong>Orders & Damaged Goods:</strong><br/><br/>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect (e.g., broken filters or wrong size), please contact Customer Service within 4 days of delivery at 1 (800) 917-0455 or hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com. We will make every effort to correct your order. Phoenix Gravity will cover return shipping for any incorrect items. Please include your order ID and order date when contacting us.<br/><br/><strong>Cancellation Policy:</strong><br/><br/>Orders cannot be canceled once dispatched. Dispatched orders will be notified via the registered email address.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
